@startuml sequence-profile
title Sequence Diagram — Workflow B: Unclaimed Profile / Non-Adoption

actor Citizen
participant "Web Client\n(React)" as UI
participant "Profile Service" as PS
participant "Receipt Service" as RS
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Ingestion Service" as IS
participant "Linking Service" as LS
participant "Moderator" as MOD

== Phase 1: Citizen Views Unclaimed Profile ==

Citizen -> UI: Open bill page
UI -> PS: GET /profiles/{id}
PS -> DB: SELECT profile WHERE status = 'unclaimed'
DB --> PS: Profile data
PS --> UI: Profile (status = unclaimed)
UI --> Citizen: Show profile with "unclaimed" badge

note over UI
  Profile shows office, jurisdiction,
  committee membership, contact channels.
  Clearly marked as unclaimed.
  No effect on receipt/outcome mechanism.
end note

== Phase 2: Citizen Submits View ==

Citizen -> UI: Submit view on bill
UI -> RS: POST /receipts
RS -> DB: INSERT participation_receipt
RS -> DB: INSERT audit_log
RS --> UI: Receipt ID + timestamp
UI --> Citizen: Show receipt confirmation

note over Citizen
  Status: "awaiting committee report"
  Receipt is tamper-evident, hash-chained.
  Office never joins or responds.
end note

== Phase 3: Committee Report Tabled (Later) ==

note over IS
  Time passes...
  Committee publishes report.
end note

IS -> IS: Fetch/download PDF
IS -> IS: Extract text (OCR if needed)
IS -> DB: INSERT committee_report
IS -> DB: INSERT report_entries
IS -> DB: UPDATE extraction_status

== Phase 4: Linking Engine Proposes Match ==

LS -> DB: Fetch receipts for bill
LS -> DB: Fetch report entries for bill
LS -> LS: Clause-reference match OR text similarity
LS -> DB: INSERT submission_match (pending)

== Phase 5: Moderator Confirms Match ==

MOD -> UI: View match queue
UI -> LS: GET /matches/pending
LS --> UI: Match details
MOD -> UI: Confirm match
UI -> LS: POST /matches/{id}/confirm
LS -> DB: UPDATE reviewer_decision = 'confirmed'
LS -> DB: INSERT audit_log

== Phase 6: Public Sees Outcome ==

Citizen -> UI: View receipt lookup
UI -> DB: SELECT confirmed match
DB --> UI: Match + treatment
UI -> UI: Compute status from ReportEntry.treatment
UI --> Citizen: Show outcome (adopted/amended/rejected/not addressed)

note over Citizen
  Neutral label + audit history.
  No allegation of misconduct.
  Non-response shown as observable fact.
end note

@enduml
